{"task":"transcribe","language":"English","duration":46.647373824,"text":" A founder running businesses in Kenya and the U.S. was keeping rent, farm operations, a spa, and dozens of bills alive by hand in spreadsheets. I'd turn that into systems that update themselves, check their own work, and report on live dashboards. And along the way, I cut about $33,000 a year in recurring costs. Every system follows the same pattern. Source data comes in, and automation verifies or processes it. it lands in a Google Sheet that stays the source of truth, a live dashboard reads from that sheet, and a person only steps in when a real decision is needed. Eight scheduled tasks across five businesses, and all of them start from one place. Every dashboard, one door.","words":[{"word":"A","start":0.16,"end":0.26},{"word":"founder","start":0.26,"end":0.62},{"word":"running","start":0.62,"end":0.84},{"word":"businesses","start":0.84,"end":1.3},{"word":"in","start":1.3,"end":1.52},{"word":"Kenya","start":1.52,"end":1.9},{"word":"and","start":1.9,"end":2.14},{"word":"the","start":2.14,"end":2.26},{"word":"U.S.","start":2.26,"end":2.72},{"word":"was","start":2.72,"end":2.94},{"word":"keeping","start":2.94,"end":3.22},{"word":"rent,","start":3.22,"end":4.18},{"word":"farm","start":4.18,"end":4.28},{"word":"operations,","start":4.28,"end":5.32},{"word":"a","start":5.32,"end":5.34},{"word":"spa,","start":5.34,"end":5.86},{"word":"and","start":5.86,"end":5.92},{"word":"dozens","start":5.92,"end":6.3},{"word":"of","start":6.3,"end":6.6},{"word":"bills","start":6.6,"end":6.96},{"word":"alive","start":6.96,"end":7.38},{"word":"by","start":7.38,"end":7.66},{"word":"hand","start":7.66,"end":8.22},{"word":"in","start":8.22,"end":8.86},{"word":"spreadsheets.","start":8.86,"end":9.5},{"word":"I'd","start":10.12,"end":10.32},{"word":"turn","start":10.32,"end":10.46},{"word":"that","start":10.46,"end":10.62},{"word":"into","start":10.62,"end":10.84},{"word":"systems","start":10.84,"end":11.26},{"word":